{"2392900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Building Simulator", "steam_appid": 2392900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MKBS is a relaxing and satisfying game about designing, building, customizing, and growing your own keyboard business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the keyboard you’ve always dreamed of without breaking the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your case, PCB, plate, switches, keycaps, colors, decals, and more to create unique custom keyboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a complete beginner or already a keyboard enthusiast, the game is designed to be fun and accessible. Learn the building process step by step, and bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your first simple build to high-end custom commissions, your journey can grow into a true mechanical keyboard enthusiast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/cb80df6af6de46fdc66ed5534933fa14.poster.avif?t=1784547052\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/cb80df6af6de46fdc66ed5534933fa14.webm?t=1784547052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/cb80df6af6de46fdc66ed5534933fa14.mp4?t=1784547052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MKBS is a relaxing and satisfying game about designing, building, customizing, and growing your own keyboard business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the keyboard you’ve always dreamed of without breaking the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your case, PCB, plate, switches, keycaps, colors, decals, and more to create unique custom keyboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a complete beginner or already a keyboard enthusiast, the game is designed to be fun and accessible. Learn the building process step by step, and bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your first simple build to high-end custom commissions, your journey can grow into a true mechanical keyboard enthusiast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/cb80df6af6de46fdc66ed5534933fa14.poster.avif?t=1784547052\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/cb80df6af6de46fdc66ed5534933fa14.webm?t=1784547052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/cb80df6af6de46fdc66ed5534933fa14.mp4?t=1784547052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Create and expand your own mechanical keyboard venture as you master the art of maintenance, repairs, and custom builds. With real-life components and realistic hardware, refine your skills, ignite your creativity, and craft a keyboard that truly resonates with you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/5094e560bcddbc2816ad43873af6c2c4741ddbe8/header.jpg?t=1784547052", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/4bc02bc44825ffbb2d628b0260a9ed44c5741d04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784547052", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/4bc02bc448